{"text":"Hi {first_name},

This is a gentle follow-up to our earlier message. {clinic_name} would like you to book a check-up visit. Please do so by {due_by}.

Call us at {clinic_phone} to pick a time. It only takes a minute.

If you would rather not get these reminders, you can stop them here: {opt_out_link}

Thank you,
{clinic_name}"}
